      "t": "2026-11-23T00:00:01Z",
      "text": "Al Jazeera reports that Trump has delayed an explosive detonation in the US state of Iowa amid legal battles.",
      "cites": [
        "news:aljazeera:e78cea294107"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-23T00:00:09Z",
      "text": "IOWA is a 2005 American independent neo-noir film directed by, written by, and starring Matt Farnsworth.",
      "cites": [
        "wiki:rev:1387220461:0"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-23T00:00:18Z",
      "text": "The film stars Matt Farnsworth, Diane Foster, Rosanna Arquette and John Savage, with music by Elia Cmiral.",
      "cites": [
        "wiki:box:1387220461:starring",
        "wiki:box:1387220461:music"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-23T00:00:26Z",
      "text": "It was released on 22 April 2005 at the Tribeca Film Festival.",
      "cites": [
        "wiki:box:1387220461:released"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-23T00:00:36Z",
      "text": "Birthplaces are on record for 3 of the credited people, and 2 of them were born in the United States.",
      "cites": [
        "wd:Q109232:P19",
        "wd:Q1328897:P19",
        "wd:Q249865:P19"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-23T00:00:44Z",
      "text": "Elia Cmíral was born further afield, in Zlín, Czechia.",
      "cites": [
        "wd:Q1328897:P19"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-23T00:00:54Z",
      "text": "Al Jazeera headlined its story, “Trump delays explosive detonation in US state of Iowa amid legal battles”.",
      "cites": [
        "news:aljazeera:e78cea294107"
      ]
    },
    {
